<title>USA: Webster Cty, Iowa, won by Nike Securities.</title>
<headline>Webster Cty, Iowa, won by Nike Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nike Securities Inc. said it won $2.500 million of Webster Cty, Iowa, general obligation county courthouse bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.69 percent.</p>
</text>
